From 03f837ee19de8886108d808b37f600cad0260fc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vibe <vibe@localhost>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:14:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Per-model LAD: collapse FoliarModel LAD/g-function vectors to
 single slots; computeLadData -> computeLadDataForModel called from treat();
 position (foliarIndice) used for all data access, indexFunction only for
 output naming

---
